  "prefLabel": "Ins 801.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 801.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to set forth the manner of reporting data by insurers to statistical agents, to prescribe reports to be submitted by statistical agents to the commissioner, and to prescribe certain conduct in connection therewith. This chapter does not apply to data reported directly by insurers to the commissioner.\n\nSource. #4468, eff 8-5-88; ss by #5649, eff 7-1-93; ss by #7027, INTERIM, eff 7-1-99, EXPIRES: 10-29-99; ss by #7108, eff 10-29-99, EXPIRED: 10-29-07\n\nNew. #9053, eff 1-2-08; ss by #11008, eff 12-31-15; ss by #14505, eff 2-7-26, EXPIRES: 2-7-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins800.html"
